Can I just not explain the geopolitics?

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.800
- [Narrator] Sure, but don't
forget that these islands

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:31.280
are also used to harvest
over 16 million euros

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.140
worth of fish and lobster.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.730
- Okay, stop, I get it.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:38.510
Military dominance, resource extraction,

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.680
science stuff, I get it.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.890
- [Narrator] But wait, while we're here,

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.780
I also wanna mention that
during the '60s and '70s,

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:47.670
France literally stole
