00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:16.830
damaging local populations
and natural environments,

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.850
and violating international law.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.070
- Yes, of course.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.830
Nukes in the Pacific Ocean,

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:26.410
damaging irreparably populations
and natural resources.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.910
I get it, yes, I should've known.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.750
I should've known, sorry.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.750
I'm just trying to do a
geography explainer, that's all.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.200
All right, let's look at one
last piece of Overseas France,

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:37.240
which is right next to French Polynesia,

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.930
but let's zoom to the
other side of the map

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.530
so we can see it better.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.870
This is New Caledonia.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:44.760
And they were actually on their way

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.280
out of being a part of France.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.540
They were on a 20 year
plan to transfer power

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.730
completely to the people of New Caledonia.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.580
But just last month,

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.160
just like literally a few
weeks ago, they voted on this.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.570
The people voted and 53% of them

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.160
said they wanted to stay with France,

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.640
while 47% wanted independence.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:05.510
- [Reporter] Voters on the
Pacific islands of New Caledonia

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:08.270
have, once again, rejected
independence from France.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.280
- France secretly loved this decision,

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:13.260
because New Caledonia is full of nickel,

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.500
something that they could mine.

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.810
- The result was welcomed

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.030
by France's President Emmanuel Macron.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:19.800
- There you go with your
natural resources again.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.270
And honestly, this vote of New Caledonia

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.170
wanting to stay with France

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:25.220
gets to the heart of the tension

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.160
in all of these colonial holdovers.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:31.600
All of these islands are the
product of French colonialism,

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.640
brutal, greedy, racist colonialism.

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.690
The people in these countries
were conquered and ruled

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.510
by this ruthless power,

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.810
who forced them to adopt their language,

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.260
their government, and
their economic structures.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:48.350
And yet here we are centuries
later in a globalized economy,

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:51.590
where the world governmental
order and system

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:54.400
was invented by these
big colonizing powers,

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.330
the Frances, the Britains of the world.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.070
France holds on to all of these islands,

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.520
because of what we just talked about,

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:02.580
military interests, expanding
their economic waters,

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:05.970
scientific research,
exploiting natural resources.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.040
And so now you have many locals

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:12.980
who live under France's rule
and many want independence,

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.700
but others realize that there are benefits

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:19.290
to being attached to the
people who invented the rules

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.790
and who still have the power.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.030
That is not an easy tension to resolve.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:27.040
For now, things likely won't change.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.600
This is France and will probably
be France for a long time.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.040
They will keep their sprawling,

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.670
low key empire around the world.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.660
And France's longest
border will continue to be

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:40.031
not with Belgium or
Spain, but with Brazil.

